<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.1999 per dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.1999 per dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.1999 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 75.2005 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     July 16		 July 15</p>
<p> High			     75.2000		 75.2700</p>
<p> Low				75.1700		 75.1999</p>
<p> Open			     75.2000		 75.2700</p>
<p> Close			    75.1999		 75.2005</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     4.455		   2.450</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
